* ===========================================================================
* Transmission gate: one extracted-cell instance per input point.
* Same forcing method as the schematic branch it replaces -- a 10 mV
* source from the forced node to the input point, so its current IS the
* channel current and R_on = 10 mV / |I| at that input.
* Pin order: gn gp vin vout vsubs vnw  (gn = vdd, gp = 0: both devices hard on;
* vin = the forced node, vout = the input point, vsubs = 0, vnw = vdd.)
vdt_f00  ndt_f00  nf00  dc 10m
Xtg_f00  vdd 0 ndt_f00 nf00 0 vdd ADC_TGATE
vdt_f17  ndt_f17  nf17  dc 10m
Xtg_f17  vdd 0 ndt_f17 nf17 0 vdd ADC_TGATE
vdt_f33  ndt_f33  nf33  dc 10m
Xtg_f33  vdd 0 ndt_f33 nf33 0 vdd ADC_TGATE
vdt_f50  ndt_f50  nf50  dc 10m
Xtg_f50  vdd 0 ndt_f50 nf50 0 vdd ADC_TGATE
vdt_f67  ndt_f67  nf67  dc 10m
Xtg_f67  vdd 0 ndt_f67 nf67 0 vdd ADC_TGATE
vdt_f83  ndt_f83  nf83  dc 10m
Xtg_f83  vdd 0 ndt_f83 nf83 0 vdd ADC_TGATE
vdt_f100  ndt_f100  nf100  dc 10m
